sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as USER / ADMIN
    participant Folio
    participant Security as Spring Security
    participant API as PaperCollectionController
    participant Service as PaperCollectionService
    participant Access as PaperAccessService
    participant MySQL
    participant Scope as ConversationScopeService

    User->>Folio: create collection
    Folio->>Security: POST /paper-collections
    Security->>Security: require USER or ADMIN
    Security->>API: authenticated userId
    API->>Service: createCollection
    Service->>MySQL: save owner, name, description
    Service-->>Folio: collection summary
    User->>Folio: add papers
    Folio->>API: POST /{collectionId}/papers
    API->>Service: addPapers
    Service->>MySQL: load visible collection
    Service->>Service: require editable collection
    Service->>Access: validate every requested paper is accessible
    Access-->>Service: authorized paper IDs
    loop new membership only
        Service->>MySQL: insert collection-paper membership
    end
    Service->>MySQL: touch collection updatedAt
    Service-->>Folio: collection detail + searchable count
    opt use collection as chat source
        Folio->>Scope: update conversation scope with collectionId
        Scope->>Service: resolve current collection paper IDs
        Scope->>MySQL: persist paper-ID snapshot
    end
    alt remove paper
        Folio->>API: DELETE /{id}/papers/{paperId}
        API->>MySQL: delete owned membership + touch collection
    else rename / describe
        Folio->>API: PUT /{id}
        API->>MySQL: verify edit permission + update fields
    else delete collection
        Folio->>API: DELETE /{id}
        API->>MySQL: delete memberships then collection
    end
